    "body": "WPT comments:\r\n- You can't create new content in WPT `/interfaces/`. That directory is managed automatically. It should probably be tested as part of other `html.idl` APIs, though perhaps it can be split, but it'll have to load `html.idl`.\r\n- It seems like we don't have tests for `<a>` and `<area>` without `href` attributes. From a quick skim I suspect this might not be implemented correctly.",
